sequenceDiagram
  participant Main as Current Session
  participant Tools as Session tools
  participant Child as Collaborator Session
  participant Files as Shared Run worktree
  Main->>Tools: session_start(input, modelId?, readOnly?, tools?)
  Tools->>Child: Create Session and start assignment
  Tools-->>Main: sessionId immediately
  Main->>Files: Continue own work
  Child->>Files: Read / edit files within granted access
  Main->>Tools: session_wait(sessionId)
  Child-->>Tools: Assignment result
  Tools-->>Main: Status and result
  Main->>Tools: session_send(sessionId, follow-up assignment)
  Tools->>Child: Next turn in the same conversation
  Child-->>Tools: Answer using existing history
  Tools-->>Main: Follow-up result
